msgid ""
"If you use multiple python versions, you might find it easier to install the"
" Python wrappers separately from PLUMED. The simplest way is to do it with "
"`pip`:"
msgstr ""

#: installation_old.md:721
msgid ""
"Here the `--user` flag allows you to install the packages on your home. "
"Notice that you don't even need to download PLUMED in order to install the "
"wrappers, but you will need PLUMED in order to use them. You can tell the "
